turbotwix — third-party attribution

This project independently implements a reader for Siemens MRI raw data (.dat / TWIX)
files. Its binary-format knowledge (byte layouts of the multi-raid file header, VB/VD/VE
scan and channel headers, eval-info-mask flag bits) and some algorithmic approaches
(category classification predicates, ascconv/XProtocol text parsing, default dimension
ordering and read flags) were derived from studying two existing open-source, MIT-licensed
projects:

* pymapvbvd
  Copyright (c) 2020 William Clarke
  https://github.com/wtclarke/pymapVBVD

* twixtools
  Copyright (c) 2021 Philipp Ehses
  https://github.com/pehses/twixtools

No source code from either project is copied verbatim; the byte-layout definitions and
protocol-header parser in this project are re-implementations informed by the above.
